### 1. Create a patient
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ram Sahu", "age": 35, "gender": "male", "phone": "9000000000" }

### 2. Create a doctor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Dr. Priya Das", "specialization": "Cardiology", "phone": "9111111111", "email": "priya@medcore.com" }

### 3. Overwrite test: this sends "id": 1 but must create a NEW doctor (id 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 1, "fullName": "Dr. Test Overwrite", "specialization": "ENT", "phone": "9222222222", "email": "test@medcore.com" }

### 4. Check doctors: Dr. Priya Das must still exist as id 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors

### 5. Create an appointment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientId": 1, "doctorId": 1, "appointmentDate": "2026-10-20", "appointmentTime": "10:30:00", "reason": "Checkup", "status": "SCHEDULED" }

### 6. Bill test: no totalAmount and no paymentDate
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientId": 1, "appointmentId": 1, "consultationFee": 500.00, "medicineFee": 200.50, "paymentStatus": "PENDING" }